        <body>
            <div xml:id="d420">

                <pb facs="0464" n="430" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg430"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McDonald to Mr. Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation for Persia</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 296.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In continuation of my dispatch No. 294, I
                    have the honor to inclose a later note to the Amine-ed-Dowlah, concerning the
                    outrages on the Jews, since which I believe matters have quieted down, as I hear
                    of no further disturbances. I have taken greater interest in this matter because
                    the American missionaries have schools in the Jewish quarter and are greatly
                    interested in them.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alex. McDonald.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d420-a1.xml" xpointer="d420-a1"/>
